*> vybe-test: cobol/compute_advanced/test_compute_max_min
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_compute_advanced.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-MAX PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-MIN PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    COMPUTE WS-MAX = FUNCTION MAX(10 5 20 15).
    COMPUTE WS-MIN = FUNCTION MIN(10 5 20 15).
    DISPLAY WS-MAX.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-MAX DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "020"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [020] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-MIN.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-MIN DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "005"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [005] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

